    {
      "text": "The Company Summary Report for Chief Information Officers (CIO Report) is an interactive report that provides information tailored for audiences like the CIO of your organization."
    },
    {
      "text": "The report covers the following information for your organization:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Peak Transactions",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Blocked Transactions Trend",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Overall Traffic",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Top Bandwidth Locations",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Cloud Applications",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Social Networking Applications",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Streaming Media Application",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Top Blocked URL Categories",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Top Blocked URL Classes",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Viruses & Spyware",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Advanced Threats",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Sandbox",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Mobile Traffic by Device Type",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Mobile Traffic by Location",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Mobile Traffic by Apps",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "About the CIO Report Page",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "As with other interactive reports, the CIO Report supports real-time interactive analysis and contains widgets that present information in different graphical formats. You can drill down to the logs for each chart by rolling over the chart, clicking, and selecting one of the following options:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Click View Logs to see its associated logs. See About Insights Logs.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Analyze Chart to see the chart in Web Insights and to drill down to the logs. See Analyzing Traffic Using Insights.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You can also:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Add custom notes to the report",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Add it your list of favorite reports",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Copy the report",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Schedule regular email deliveries of the report",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Print the report",
      "depth": 0
    }
  ]
